@startuml
!pragma teoz true
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2563A6
  LifeLineBorderColor #ABBCCE
  ParticipantBorderColor #B5C8DA
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F6FA
  ParticipantFontColor #142B43
  GroupBorderColor #8A9BAE
  GroupBackgroundColor #F6F8FB
}
title Registro y verificación CIMD
autonumber
participant "Administrador" as Admin
participant "Auth0 (HTTPS :443)" as Auth0
participant "Nexus MCP server (:3001)" as NexusMcp
participant "Nexus API server (:3000)" as NexusApi
Admin->Auth0: Importar URL HTTPS del documento CIMD
Auth0->NexusMcp: GET /.well-known/client-metadata
NexusMcp-->Auth0: client_id URL, nombre, redirects y grants
Auth0-->Admin: Registro del cliente CIMD
Admin->NexusApi: Ejecutar verificación del módulo
NexusApi->Auth0: Consultar clients por external_client_id público
Auth0-->NexusApi: Registro encontrado o lista vacía
NexusApi-->Admin: Resultado de verificación
@enduml
